GENE.closure_formula:
$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial g_s}{\partial t} &+ \left(v_\parallel \hat{\mathbf{b}} + \mathbf{v}_D\right) \cdot \nabla g_s
+ \dot{v}_\parallel \frac{\partial g_s}{\partial v_\parallel}
= - \frac{Z_s e F_{0s}}{T_s} \left(\frac{\partial}{\partial t} + i\omega_{*s}\right) \langle \chi \rangle_{\mathbf{R}} + C[g_s] \\[4pt]
\chi &= \phi - \frac{v_\parallel}{c} A_\parallel + \frac{\mu}{Z_s e} B_\parallel \\[4pt]
\mathbf{v}_D &= \frac{\hat{\mathbf{b}}}{\Omega_s} \times \left(v_\parallel^2 \boldsymbol{\kappa} + \frac{\mu}{m_s} \nabla B\right) \\[4pt]
\nabla_\perp^2 \phi &= -4\pi \sum_s Z_s e \int d^3v\, J_0(k_\perp \rho_s) g_s \quad &\text{(准中性)} \\[4pt]
-\nabla_\perp^2 A_\parallel &= \frac{4\pi}{c} \sum_s Z_s e \int d^3v\, v_\parallel J_0(k_\perp \rho_s) g_s \quad &\text{(Ampère)}
\end{aligned}
$$

