TORAX.closure_formula:
$$
\begin{aligned}
&\text{电子能量:} \quad \frac{3}{2}\frac{\partial}{\partial t}(n_e T_e) = \nabla \cdot (n_e \chi_e \nabla T_e) + Q_e - Q_{ei} \\[4pt]
&\text{离子能量:} \quad \frac{3}{2}\frac{\partial}{\partial t}(n_i T_i) = \nabla \cdot (n_i \chi_i \nabla T_i) + Q_{ei} + Q_i \\[4pt]
&\text{电流扩散:} \quad \sigma_\parallel \frac{\partial \psi}{\partial t} = \frac{1}{\mu_0 \rho}\frac{\partial}{\partial \rho}\left(\frac{\rho G_2}{R_0}\frac{\partial \psi}{\partial \rho}\right) + \frac{j_{\text{BS}} + j_{\text{CD}}}{\eta_\parallel} \\[4pt]
&\text{输运闭合:} \quad \chi_{e,i} = \chi_{e,i}^{\text{Bohm}} + \chi_{e,i}^{\text{gyroBohm}} + \chi_{e,i}^{\text{TGLF/QuaLiKiz}}
\end{aligned}
$$

GX.closure_formula:
$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial g_s}{\partial t} &= \mathcal{L}[g_s] + \mathcal{N}[g_s, g_s] \\[4pt]
\mathcal{L}[g_s] &= -\left(v_\parallel \hat{\mathbf{b}} + \mathbf{v}_D\right) \cdot \nabla g_s + \frac{Z_s e}{T_s} F_{0s} v_\parallel \hat{\mathbf{b}} \cdot \nabla \langle \chi \rangle_{\mathbf{R}} \\[4pt]
g_s &= \sum_{m=0}^{N_v} \sum_{\ell=0}^{N_\mu} C_{m\ell}(\mathbf{x}) H_m(\bar{v}_\parallel) L_\ell(\bar{\mu}) \quad \text{(Hermite-Laguerre 谱展开)}
\end{aligned}
$$

