$$

Gkeyll.closure_formula:
$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial f_s}{\partial t} + \nabla_\mathbf{x} \cdot (\mathbf{v} f_s) + \nabla_\mathbf{v} &\cdot \left[\frac{q_s}{m_s}(\mathbf{E} + \mathbf{v}\times\mathbf{B}) f_s\right] = 0 \\[4pt]
\frac{\partial \mathbf{B}}{\partial t} + \nabla \times \mathbf{E} &= 0, \quad \frac{\partial \mathbf{E}}{\partial t} - c^2\nabla\times\mathbf{B} = -\frac{\mathbf{J}}{\varepsilon_0} \\[4pt]
f_s^h(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{v},t) &= \sum_{k=1}^{N_p} f_{s,k}(t)\,\phi_k(\mathbf{x},\mathbf{v}) \quad \text{(DG 基函数展开)}
\end{aligned}
$$

VPIC.closure_formula:
$$
